{"id":781,"date":"2020-06-17T22:12:39","date_gmt":"2020-06-17T22:12:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=781"},"modified":"2020-12-18T15:18:21","modified_gmt":"2020-12-18T15:18:21","slug":"amplify-queens-now-powered-by-interise","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/amplify-queens-now-powered-by-interise\/","title":{"rendered":"Amplify Queens NOW powered by Interise"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">RDRC\/Interise Amplify Queens NOW Program<\/span><!--more--><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/17qy8ga9uLnebT1mudj1Uu9DkWAC8m7uV\/view?usp=sharing\"><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Amplify Queens NOW<\/span><\/a><\/span> powered by Interise, a one-week online program for business owners to incorporate crisis management tactics and strategies to navigate uncertainty and survive the financial shock of the COVID-19 crisis.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">During the Great Recession, businesses powered by Interise created jobs at a 21% growth rate, while the economy was losing jobs. Together, we can do it again \u2014 small business owners; this network is here for you. The result? Small business owners are equipped with crisis management tactics and strategies and primed to exit this crisis confident and ready to navigate uncertainty\u2014a lead facilitator to guide a cohort of 25 business owners through this five-day program. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Four one-hour sessions attended live by cohort and guest experts. Each session focuses on a business topic critical for small business owners to navigate uncertainty and survive financial shock: People: Supporting your employees and yourself Financial Picture: Analysis of your company finances Accessing Capital: Federal, state, and local resources Strategies to Survive: Key